from filename "../../module/hymn_manuscript.pya" to name hymn manuscript be import do

ob ve filename text source be input ya
su name provider auto discharge ob bool lie ya
su name music workflow default ob text "ace-step-1.5-power_comfyui" be default ya

exists su name album profile key ob text "power-ace-step" be text ya
exists su name album style key ob text "Bb major" be text ya
exists su name album style text ob text "Spiritual devotional ambient electronic hymn, warm analog pads, gentle pulse, luminous choir texture, spacious mix, reverent mood, no harsh distortion." be text ya
exists su name album style fixed seed ob num 424242 be number ya

su name album style profile be map def
  su name profile key ob name text album profile key ya
  su name key ob name text album style key ya
  su name style text ob name text album style text ya
  su name fixed seed ob num 424242 ya
prah

exists su name archetype hook generator mind be mind as name "qwen3.5:9b" fromtext text "You prepare short hook hints for stage-based spiritual manuscript generation." ya
exists su name archetype hook verifier mind be mind as name "qwen3.5:9b" fromtext text "You strictly select the strongest stage-fitting hooks from a candidate list." ya

exists su name stage prompt template ob text quoted.text.You are preparing hook hints for a spiritual hymn manuscript generator.

Stage name: [[stage_name]]

What this stage does:
[[stage_role]]

Task:
Read the source text and produce 8 to 12 short hook hints for this stage.

Rules:
- output only hook hints
- one hook hint per line
- no numbering
- no bullet points
- 3 to 7 words is preferred
- use source wording when possible
- small faithful variations are allowed
- make them singable and memorable
- avoid writing full lyrics
- avoid explanations

Source:
[[source]].text.quoted be text ya

exists su name stage verify template ob text quoted.text.You are selecting the strongest stage hooks.

Stage name:
[[stage_name]]

Stage role:
[[stage_role]]

Candidate hooks:
[[candidate_hooks]]

Task:
- select top stage-fitting hooks
- preserve source faithfulness
- prefer concise memorable phrasing

Output rules:
- return 3 or 4 hooks
- one hook per line
- no numbering
- no bullet points
- no labels
- no explanations
- no markdown
- keep each hook to 3 to 9 words where possible..text.quoted be text ya

exists su name replacement stage name ob text "" be text ya
exists su name replacement stage role ob text "" be text ya
exists su name replacement source text ob text "" be text ya
exists su name replacement candidate hooks ob text "" be text ya

su name replacements be map def
  su text "[[stage_name]]" ob name text replacement stage name ya
  su text "[[stage_role]]" ob name text replacement stage role ya
  su text "[[source]]" ob name text replacement source text ya
  su text "[[candidate_hooks]]" ob name text replacement candidate hooks ya
prah

exists su name text paragraph break ob text quoted.text.

.text.quoted be text ya
exists su name text album current stage ob text "" be text ya

su name stage hook run from text stage name with text stage role to name text stage hooks out be ceremony def
  ob text of from of this to name text replacement stage name be text do
  ob text of with of this to name text replacement stage role be text do
  ob name text source text to name text replacement source text be text do

  su name stage prompt stage ob name map replacements in name text stage prompt template to name text stage prompt be instead do
  su name stage candidate hooks stage ob name text stage prompt for name archetype hook generator mind to name text stage candidate hooks by num 0 atmost num 240 be write do

  ob name text stage candidate hooks to name text replacement candidate hooks be text do
  su name stage verify prompt stage ob name map replacements in name text stage verify template to name text stage verify prompt be instead do
  su name stage hooks selected stage ob name text stage verify prompt for name archetype hook verifier mind to name text stage hooks out by num 0 atmost num 140 be write do

  su name stage hooks out ret
prah

su name album hook song render be ceremony def
  su name hook line stage ob text of ob of this to name text hook line be text do
  su name hook text stage ob name text hook line to name text hook text be text do

  su name hymn lyrics stage from filename of source with text of hook line to name text hymn lyrics be hymn manuscript do
  su name hymn row stage be map def
    su name stage ob name text album current stage ya
    su name hook ob name text hook text ya
    su name lyrics ob name text hymn lyrics ya
  prah

  su name render row stage ob text "[song]" to name text render row be text do
  ob name text paragraph break to name render row be plus do
  ob text "stage: " to name render row be plus do
  ob name text album current stage to name render row be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name render row be plus do
  ob text "hook: " to name render row be plus do
  ob name text hook line to name render row be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name render row be plus do
  ob name text hymn lyrics to name render row be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name render row be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name render row be plus do
  ob name text render row to name text album songbook be plus do
  su name hymn row stage ret
prah

su name album hymn music render with text stage name to name map song row be ceremony def
  su name hymn hook stage ob text of ob of hook of map of ob of this to name text hymn hook be text do
  su name hymn lyrics stage ob text of ob of lyrics of map of ob of this to name text hymn lyrics be text do
  su name hymn audio stage fromtext text "Spiritual devotional ambient electronic hymn, warm analog pads, gentle pulse, luminous choir texture, spacious mix, reverent mood, no harsh distortion." ob name text hymn lyrics be music say do

  su name song row stage be map def
    su name stage ob text of with of this ya
    su name hook ob name text hymn hook ya
    su name lyrics ob name text hymn lyrics ya
    su name audio ob filename of ob of hymn audio stage ya
  prah
  su name song row stage ret
prah

su name album archetype hook refinery run be refinery def
  su name source load stage from filename of ob of source become wo text to name text source text be read do

  su name seed hooks stage from text "seed" with text "This stage introduces the core idea in its first living form. It names the central truth or possibility before it is tested. It should feel simple, clear, and foundational." to name text seed hooks be stage hook run do
  su name awake hooks stage from text "awake" with text "This stage is the awakening or activation of the seed. It shows invitation, opening, encouragement, inner prompting, or the beginning of movement. It should feel like the idea is becoming alive and possible." to name text awake hooks be stage hook run do
  su name challenge hooks stage from text "challenge" with text "This stage shows what resists, tests, blocks, or distorts the teaching. It includes fear, confusion, judgment, separation, false belief, pain, or misuse. It should feel like the teaching is being brought into tension." to name text challenge hooks be stage hook run do
  su name experience hooks stage from text "experience" with text "This stage shows the teaching being lived, felt, or worked through. It is the actual experience of engaging the challenge and moving within the teaching. It should feel embodied, active, and present." to name text experience hooks be stage hook run do
  su name integrated self hooks stage from text "integrated self" with text "This stage shows the self after learning has taken root. It expresses stable inner understanding, identity, clarity, sovereignty, transparency, or mature selfhood. It should feel settled, centred, and true." to name text integrated self hooks be stage hook run do
  su name transformation hooks stage from text "transformation" with text "This stage shows the self or situation being changed. It includes release, forgiveness, purification, healing, transmutation, or deep inner turning. It should feel like something real is being altered." to name text transformation hooks be stage hook run do
  su name highway hooks stage from text "highway" with text "This stage shows the onward path after transformation. It expresses the new mode of being, the continuing walk, the opened road, or the settled path forward. It should feel spacious, steady, and complete." to name text highway hooks be stage hook run do

  su name output start stage ob text "[seed]" to name text output be text do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob name text seed hooks to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob text "[awake]" to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob name text awake hooks to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob text "[challenge]" to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob name text challenge hooks to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob text "[experience]" to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob name text experience hooks to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob text "[integrated self]" to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob name text integrated self hooks to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob text "[transformation]" to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob name text transformation hooks to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob text "[highway]" to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob name text highway hooks to name output be plus do

  su name album lyrics stage ob name text seed hooks to name text album lyrics be text do
  ob name text paragraph break to name album lyrics be plus do
  ob name text awake hooks to name album lyrics be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name album lyrics be plus do
  ob name text challenge hooks to name album lyrics be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name album lyrics be plus do
  ob name text experience hooks to name album lyrics be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name album lyrics be plus do
  ob name text integrated self hooks to name album lyrics be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name album lyrics be plus do
  ob name text transformation hooks to name album lyrics be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name album lyrics be plus do
  ob name text highway hooks to name album lyrics be plus do

  su name songbook init stage ob text "" to name text album songbook be text do

  ob text "seed" to name text album current stage be text do
  ob text "node command/filter_hymn_hook_candidates.mjs" fromtext name seed hooks to name text seed hooks cleaned be command do
  ob name text seed hooks cleaned by wo newline to name vec seedhooksvec be distribute do
  ob name seedhooksvec at name all be album hook song render do
  from name seedhooksvec to name series seedhymns be series do
  from name seedhymns with text "seed" by name album hymn music render to name text seedsongrows be series map do

  ob text "awake" to name text album current stage be text do
  ob text "node command/filter_hymn_hook_candidates.mjs" fromtext name awake hooks to name text awake hooks cleaned be command do
  ob name text awake hooks cleaned by wo newline to name vec awakehooksvec be distribute do
  ob name awakehooksvec at name all be album hook song render do
  from name awakehooksvec to name series awakehymns be series do
  from name awakehymns with text "awake" by name album hymn music render to name text awakesongrows be series map do

  ob text "challenge" to name text album current stage be text do
  ob text "node command/filter_hymn_hook_candidates.mjs" fromtext name challenge hooks to name text challenge hooks cleaned be command do
  ob name text challenge hooks cleaned by wo newline to name vec challengehooksvec be distribute do
  ob name challengehooksvec at name all be album hook song render do
  from name challengehooksvec to name series challengehymns be series do
  from name challengehymns with text "challenge" by name album hymn music render to name text challengesongrows be series map do

  ob text "experience" to name text album current stage be text do
  ob text "node command/filter_hymn_hook_candidates.mjs" fromtext name experience hooks to name text experience hooks cleaned be command do
  ob name text experience hooks cleaned by wo newline to name vec experiencehooksvec be distribute do
  ob name experiencehooksvec at name all be album hook song render do
  from name experiencehooksvec to name series experiencehymns be series do
  from name experiencehymns with text "experience" by name album hymn music render to name text experiencesongrows be series map do

  ob text "integrated self" to name text album current stage be text do
  ob text "node command/filter_hymn_hook_candidates.mjs" fromtext name integrated self hooks to name text integrated self hooks cleaned be command do
  ob name text integrated self hooks cleaned by wo newline to name vec integratedselfhooksvec be distribute do
  ob name integratedselfhooksvec at name all be album hook song render do
  from name integratedselfhooksvec to name series integratedselfhymns be series do
  from name integratedselfhymns with text "integrated self" by name album hymn music render to name text integratedselfsongrows be series map do

  ob text "transformation" to name text album current stage be text do
  ob text "node command/filter_hymn_hook_candidates.mjs" fromtext name transformation hooks to name text transformation hooks cleaned be command do
  ob name text transformation hooks cleaned by wo newline to name vec transformationhooksvec be distribute do
  ob name transformationhooksvec at name all be album hook song render do
  from name transformationhooksvec to name series transformationhymns be series do
  from name transformationhymns with text "transformation" by name album hymn music render to name text transformationsongrows be series map do

  ob text "highway" to name text album current stage be text do
  ob text "node command/filter_hymn_hook_candidates.mjs" fromtext name highway hooks to name text highway hooks cleaned be command do
  ob name text highway hooks cleaned by wo newline to name vec highwayhooksvec be distribute do
  ob name highwayhooksvec at name all be album hook song render do
  from name highwayhooksvec to name series highwayhymns be series do
  from name highwayhymns with text "highway" by name album hymn music render to name text highwaysongrows be series map do

  su name album hymn series stage be series def
    su name seed hymns ob name series seedhymns be series ya
    su name awake hymns ob name series awakehymns be series ya
    su name challenge hymns ob name series challengehymns be series ya
    su name experience hymns ob name series experiencehymns be series ya
    su name integrated self hymns ob name series integratedselfhymns be series ya
    su name transformation hymns ob name series transformationhymns be series ya
    su name highway hymns ob name series highwayhymns be series ya
  prah
  su name album song series stage be series def
    su name seed songs ob name series seedsongrows be series ya
    su name awake songs ob name series awakesongrows be series ya
    su name challenge songs ob name series challengesongrows be series ya
    su name experience songs ob name series experiencesongrows be series ya
    su name integrated self songs ob name series integratedselfsongrows be series ya
    su name transformation songs ob name series transformationsongrows be series ya
    su name highway songs ob name series highwaysongrows be series ya
  prah

  ob name text output be write do
  ob name text album songbook be write do
  ob name series album hymn series stage be write do
  ob name series album song series stage be write do
  su name album concatenate stage from name series album song series stage fromstate wo series become wo audio be concatenate do
  ob filename of ob of album concatenate stage be write do
  ob name album style profile be write do
prah

from name album archetype hook refinery run to name text result be refinery do
ob name result be write do
